       }
      ],
      "text": "Central line indications:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " pressors, antibiotics, chemo, volume or hypertonic saline, CVP monitoring, transvenous pacing."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
